{"candidateAnswer":"A few different natural settings outdoors","evidence":"[D6:16 | 8:18 pm on 6 July, 2023] Melanie: Glad you have support, Caroline! Unconditional love is so important. Here's a pic of my family camping at the beach. We love it, it brings us closer!\n[D4:6 | 10:37 am on 27 June, 2023] Melanie: That sounds great, Caroline! It's awesome having stuff around that make us think of good connections and times. Actually, I just took my fam camping in the mountains last week - it was a really nice time together!\n[D8:32 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Melanie: Yeah, Caroline, my family's been great - their love and support really helped me through tough times. It's awesome! We even went on another camping trip in the forest.","itemId":"urn:uuid:74516fb7-cadf-5307-b6f2-c58443c75b85","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:85b7e5f7678bb6d546fba0df9072baf15d20eb19d109b4242aecbbf521e5610d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where has Melanie camped?","referenceAnswer":"beach, mountains, forest","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"85b7e5f7678bb6d546fba0df9072baf15d20eb19d109b4242aecbbf521e5610d"}}]}